  {
   "text": "severity=block 的规则命中后，系统自动重新生成（最多 3 次），并在 prompt 中注入规避指导。你也可以在 OpenClaw 里查看、添加、禁用规则，或者调整严重级别。",
   "file": "h_claw-design__1.txt",
   "section": "Slop 黑名单：干掉 AI 味",
   "category": "Agent workflow",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": false
  },
  {
   "text": "`generate` 的意图识别走文本 LLM 语义理解，不做关键词匹配降级。CLI 本身不内置 LLM：",
   "file": "h_claw-design__1.txt",
   "section": "关于意图识别（重要）",
   "category": "Agent workflow",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": false
  },
  {
   "text": "在已配置文本 LLM 的 **OpenClaw** 里使用时，宿主会注入 LLM，`generate` 正常工作。",
   "file": "h_claw-design__1.txt",
   "section": "关于意图识别（重要）",
   "category": "Agent workflow",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": false
  },
  {
   "text": "直接 `npm` 装的裸 CLI 没有注入 LLM 时，`generate` 不会瞎猜意图，而是报错并提示你去 OpenClaw 使用，或在程序内通过 `createPipeline(theme, { classifierProvider })` 注入文本 LLM classifier。",
   "file": "h_claw-design__1.txt",
   "section": "关于意图识别（重要）",
   "category": "Agent workflow",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": false
  },
  {
   "text": "`slop-list`、`--help`、`--version` 不依赖 LLM，任何环境都能直接用。",
   "file": "h_claw-design__1.txt",
   "section": "关于意图识别（重要）",
   "category": "Agent workflow",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": false
  },
  {
   "text": "紫蓝渐变背景（purple-to-blue / purple-to-pink linear-gradient 作为大面积背景）。",
   "file": "h_claw-design__3.txt",
   "section": "Slop rule: generic-purple-gradient",
   "category": "Color",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": false
  },
  {
   "text": "用通用 emoji 字符代替专业 SVG/icon-font 图标。",
   "file": "h_claw-design__3.txt",
   "section": "Slop rule: emoji-as-icon",
   "category": "Components",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Inter 字体用作标题或展示字体（Inter 只适合 body text）。",
   "file": "h_claw-design__3.txt",
   "section": "Slop rule: inter-as-display",
   "category": "Type",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": false
  },
  {
