   "file": "h_claw-design__3.txt",
   "section": "Slop rule: hand-drawn-faces",
   "category": "Components",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": false
  },
  {
   "text": "在 img alt 或注释中使用通用 stock photo 风格描述。",
   "file": "h_claw-design__3.txt",
   "section": "Slop rule: stock-photo-description",
   "category": "Content & process",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": false
  },
  {
   "text": "残留 Lorem ipsum、placeholder text 或明显占位文本。",
