   "section": "Slop rule: excessive-border-radius",
   "category": "Surface",
   "command": null,
   "measurable": true
  },
  {
   "text": "hero section 采用\"大标题 + 副标题 + 单个 CTA 按钮垂直居中\"的千篇一律布局。",
